 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have a cough, and it hurts on my right side."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "When did you first notice it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My grandson visited on Sunday, that was nice."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything that makes it better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The pain only comes on when I cough."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How would you describe the feeling in your own words?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "The cough is dry."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Where exactly do you feel it, and does it spread anywhere?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Right side of my tummy."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "On a scale from 0 to 10, where 10 is the worst, how bad is it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I couldn't really put a number on it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is it there all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It comes on when I cough."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has anything else been bothering you along with this?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I've been aching all over."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you see a doctor regularly for any health condition?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I have high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Which medicines do you take regularly, including any new ones?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I can't remember the names of them."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Are you allergic to any medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Has this changed what you can do around the house or outside?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I still do my own cooking, mostly."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything about this that worries you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My daughter worries more than I do, honestly."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
